{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24836","headline":"游陆先生故岩居 · 杨衡","name":"游陆先生故岩居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独壑临万嶂，苍苔绝行迹。\n仰窥猨挂树，俯对鹤巢石。\n上有一岩屋，相传灵人宅。\n深林无阳晖，幽水转鲜碧。\n拾薪遇遗鼎，探穴得古籍。\n结念候云兴，烧香坐终夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}